      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "This product flow identifies the supplied electricity consumed in Stages II-IV of the soil-washing remediation case documented by Kim et al. (2013), Table 1, DOI 10.1007/s11356-013-1599-8. The source reports electricity in kWh but does not report generation mix, voltage level, supplier or the transmission-and-distribution loss boundary. The reference property uses the platform's current energy basis; exchange quantities retain the transparent kWh-to-MJ conversion.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "本产品流标识 Kim 等（2013）土壤淋洗修复案例第二至第四阶段消耗的外购电力，依据论文表1，DOI 10.1007/s11356-013-1599-8。来源以kWh报告用电量，但未说明发电结构、电压等级、供应商或输配电损耗边界。参考流属性采用平台当前能量基准，exchange 数值保留从kWh换算为MJ的透明计算。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
